+
+## Supported task families
+
+| Task | Input | Output | Evaluation |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Question answering | Query + corpus | Answer + citations | exact match, semantic similarity, evidence faithfulness |
+| Relation extraction | Document + schema | Typed relations + evidence | micro F1, macro F1, per-label metrics |
+| Claim verification | Claim + corpus | supported/refuted/insufficient + evidence | accuracy, evidence precision, judge agreement |
+| Summarization | Document or corpus | Summary + citations | coverage, compression, faithfulness |
+| Ontology linking | Mentions + ontology | Concept candidates | Hits@k, MRR, calibration |
+| Graph construction | Corpus + schema | Nodes, edges, evidence | triple F1, graph consistency, coverage |
+| Evidence selection | Query/task + corpus | Ranked evidence | recall@k, precision@k, nDCG |
