+## Installation
+
+### Base installation
+
+Install only the lightweight core:
+
+```bash
+pip install ragtree
+```
+
+For local development from the repository:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/<your-org-or-user>/RAGTree.git
+cd RAGTree
+python -m venv .venv
+source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows: .venv\\Scripts\\activate
+pip install -e .
+```
+
+### Optional integrations
+
+Install only the adapters you need.
+
+```bash
+pip install "ragtree[llm-openai]"
+pip install "ragtree[llm-ollama]"
+pip install "ragtree[llm-litellm]"
+pip install "ragtree[embeddings]"
+pip install "ragtree[vector-chroma]"
+pip install "ragtree[vector-qdrant]"
+pip install "ragtree[vector-faiss]"
+pip install "ragtree[neo4j]"
+pip install "ragtree[rdf]"
+pip install "ragtree[api]"
+pip install "ragtree[ui]"
+pip install "ragtree[notebooks]"
+pip install "ragtree[docs]"
+pip install "ragtree[dev]"
+```
+
+Install a combined local stack:
+
+```bash
+pip install -e ".[llm-litellm,embeddings,vector-chroma,neo4j,rdf,api,ui,dev]"
+```
+
+Install the full research and demo stack:
+
+```bash
+pip install -e ".[all]"
+```
