+The library should eventually expose task-oriented usage like this:
+
+```python
+from ragtree import RAGTree
+from ragtree.tasks import QuestionAnsweringTask
+from ragtree.adapters.llms import LiteLLMProvider
+from ragtree.adapters.vectorstores import ChromaVectorStore
