+app = RAGTree(
+    llm=LiteLLMProvider(model="openai/gpt-4o-mini"),
+    vector_store=ChromaVectorStore(collection="ragtree-demo"),
+    graph_store=Neo4jGraphStore(uri="bolt://localhost:7687"),
+)
+
+result = app.run(
+    task=QuestionAnsweringTask(
+        question="What evidence explains the observed failure?"
+    ),
+    corpus="data/demo",
+)
+
+print(result.answer)
+print(result.evidence)
+print(result.metrics)
+```
+
+This is the target API. Current workflows remain script-based while the library contracts are stabilized.
